<p>As you may know, my wife and I have recently moved to Seattle, WA. I will be taking space in a new studio starting in December at which point I will resume my normal painting schedule.</p>
<p>My email address, web site and phone number will all remain the same. You can get in touch with me at any time via my web site <a href="http://www.portraitsbysimonbland.com/home/contact" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">contact page</a>.</p>
<p>I am currently taking commissions for delivery in the spring of 2016. Please don't hesitate to get in touch if I can help with any questions or provide more information.</p>